ould track and untrack jobs 0ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > job tracking > should not track jobs after being closed 0ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > job tracking > should clear all tracked jobs when closed 0ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > job tracking > should ignore empty job ids 0ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > lock renewal > should extend locks for tracked jobs 602ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > lock renewal > should emit error when lock extension fails 303ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > lock renewal > should emit error when extendJobLocks throws 303ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > lock renewal > should not extend locks if no jobs need renewal 303ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > lock renewal > should update timestamps for jobs without initial timestamp 253ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > integration with Worker > should track jobs during processing 167ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > integration with Worker > should untrack jobs on failure 60ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > integration with Worker > should continue renewing locks for long-running jobs 3008ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > integration with Worker > should handle lock manager closure during worker shutdown 5ms\n ✓ tests/lock_manager.test.ts > LockManager > telemetry > should call trace when extending locks 301ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .remove > removes processed hash 18ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .moveToCompleted > should not fail if queue meta key is missing 4ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .moveToCompleted > should not complete a parent job before its children 9ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .moveToFailed > when job is removed > should not save stacktrace 114ms\n\n Test Files  7 passed (7)\n      Test